_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-49841fbbc93e7e0c4f13","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-050171ace44ad893ac4c","layer":"original","quote":"耸，越骑校尉，累迁廷尉〖3〗，湘东、河间太守","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-7e6370e34da360fde98c","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-dc6a2fa131861cc421ac","layer":"pei","quote":"时王岐难耸，以高士所达，必合秀异。耸书与族子察曰：‘世之取士，曾不招未齿于丘园，索良才于总猥；所誉依已成，所毁依已败。此吾所以叹息也","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e06f133cf78fd78cb18","start":75,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-bf1f9b5191de780a9687","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-dc6a2fa131861cc421ac","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“耸，字世龙。翻第六子也。清虚无欲，进退以礼。在吴，历清官。入晋，除河间相；王素闻耸名，厚敬礼之。耸抽引人物，务在幽隐孤陋之中。时王岐难耸，以高士所达，必合秀异。耸书与族子察曰：‘世之取士，曾不招未齿于丘园，索良才于总猥；所誉依已成，所毁依已败。此吾所以叹息也！’耸疾俗丧祭无度；弟昺卒，祭以少牢，酒饭而已。当时族党并遵行之。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e06f133cf78fd78cb18","start":0,"end":175,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-c320002be4a093c2b42d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-dc6a2fa131861cc421ac","layer":"pei","quote":"入晋，除河间相；王素闻耸名，厚敬礼之。耸抽引人物，务在幽隐孤陋之中","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e06f133cf78fd78cb18","start":41,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
